==German==

===Etymology===
Compound of [[Sonntag]] and [[Kleidung]]. From the habit of going to church on Sunday. Especially in the rural population, the work clothes were changed for special fine clothing only worn on that day.

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||-}}

# [[churchgoing]] [[outfit]]; one's [[Sunday best]]

